    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix(cloudflare-ai-gateway): add Ember-1 lab file and curate its CF route (#10081)

Cloudflare added fireworks/ember-1 to its proxied catalog, which failed the
hourly sync because no models/ lab file existed. Add models/fireworks/ember-1
and curate the CF route&amp;#39;s reasoning options (none|low|high|max) and
interleaved reasoning_content, verified live against Cloudflare.

Also correct the skip note for Inkling: it has a lab file but is BYOK-only on
unified billing.

Co-authored-by: rekram1-node &amp;lt;rekram1-node@users.noreply.github.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
